    m_Localized: "\xD6nceden kazan\u0131lm\u0131\u015F se\xE7imler de\u011Fi\u015Fmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898132
    m_Localized: "kazan\xE7: {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898133
    m_Localized: 'bedel: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898134
    m_Localized: "Level ba\u015F\u0131na se\xE7im: {0} (temel {1}) \xB7 yeni kazan\u0131lan
      level'lar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898135
    m_Localized: "{0} A\u015EAMA \xB7 BOSS \xD6D\xDCL\xDC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898136
    m_Localized: "{0} A\u015EAMA \xB7 Round {1} boss'undan itibaren"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898137
    m_Localized: "{0} A\u015EAMA"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898138
    m_Localized: "Uygun \xF6d\xFCl kalmad\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898139
    m_Localized: "B\xFCt\xFCn \xF6d\xFCller s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131nda ya da \u015Fu
      an bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmiyor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898140
    m_Localized: DEVAM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898141
    m_Localized: "BOSS GE\xC7\u0130LD\u0130 \xB7 \xD6D\xDCL SE\xC7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898142
    m_Localized: "SON BOSS GE\xC7\u0130LD\u0130 \xB7 \xD6D\xDCL SE\xC7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898143
    m_Localized: "Bu boss i\xE7in sunulabilecek \xF6d\xFCl yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898144
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z biri al\u0131n\u0131r \xB7 run sonuna kadar ge\xE7erli
      \xB7 etkisi Round {0} ve sonras\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898145
    m_Localized: "yaln\u0131z biri al\u0131n\u0131r \xB7 run sonuna kadar ge\xE7erli
      \xB7 etkisi Round {0} ve sonras\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898146
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z biri al\u0131n\u0131r \xB7 run burada biter \xB7 \xF6d\xFCl
      run sonu listesine yaz\u0131l\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898147
    m_Localized: "yaln\u0131z biri al\u0131n\u0131r \xB7 run burada biter \xB7 \xF6d\xFCl
      run sonu listesine yaz\u0131l\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898148
    m_Localized: "Boss ge\xE7ildi \xB7 {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898149
    m_Localized: "Son boss ge\xE7ildi \xB7 {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898150
    m_Localized: "KAZAN\xC7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898151
    m_Localized: BEDEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898152
    m_Localized: "\u015Eu an {0}/{1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898153
    m_Localized: "\u015Eu an {0}/{1}: toplam {2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898154
    m_Localized: "\u015Eu an 0/{0}: yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898155
    m_Localized: "Se\xE7ince {0}/{1}: toplam {2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898156
    m_Localized: "Al\u0131nan boss \xF6d\xFClleri"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898157
    m_Localized: "ANTEN\u0130 YERLE\u015ET\u0130R"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898158
    m_Localized: "Tarlan\u0131n kenar\u0131nda bir konum se\xE7 \xB7 anten i\xE7eri
      bakar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898159
    m_Localized: "kenardaki anten, bakt\u0131\u011F\u0131 y\xF6ndeki ilk {0} h\xFCcreye
      {1} sn'de bir vurur \xB7 hasat hasar\u0131n\u0131n %{2}'i"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898160
    m_Localized: "hat, davran\u0131\u015Fl\u0131 saks\u0131n\u0131n bitkisini hasat
      ederse o saks\u0131n\u0131n davran\u0131\u015F \u015Fans\u0131yla ek hat vuru\u015Fu
      \xB7 hasar\u0131n %{0}'i \xB7 bekleme {1} sn"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898161
    m_Localized: "\u0130K\u0130NC\u0130 ANTEN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898162
    m_Localized: "\u0130lk antenle ayn\u0131 hizada, kar\u015F\u0131 kenara yerle\u015Fir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898163
    m_Localized: "ayn\u0131 hizada kar\u015F\u0131 kenara ikinci anten \xB7 iki anten
      aras\u0131ndaki h\xFCcrelere {0} sn'de bir hat vuru\u015Fu \xB7 hasat hasar\u0131n\u0131n
      %{1}'i"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898164
    m_Localized: "her {0} do\u011Frudan bitki isabetinde fareden hilal \xB7 rastgele
      ana y\xF6nde en fazla {1} birim \xB7 hasat hasar\u0131n\u0131n %{2}'i"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898165
    m_Localized: "her {0} ge\xE7erli vuru\u015Fta bir hilal \xB7 {1} h\xFCcre ilerler
      \xB7 hasat hasar\u0131n\u0131n %{2}'i"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898166
    m_Localized: "kritik vuru\u015F, {0} h\xFCcre i\xE7indeki ba\u015Fka bir bitkiye
      ark s\u0131\xE7rat\u0131r \xB7 kritik hasar\u0131n %{1}'i \xB7 vuru\u015F ba\u015F\u0131na
      en \xE7ok {2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898167
    m_Localized: "tek vuru\u015Fta {0}+ bitkiye kritik: merkezde ek alan vuru\u015Fu
      \xB7 hasat hasar\u0131 \xD7 kritik \xE7arpan\u0131n\u0131n %{1}'i"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898168
    m_Localized: "her ana hilalle mouse halkas\u0131ndan bir b\xFCy\xFCk ek hilal
      \xB7 ana hilalden farkl\u0131 rastgele y\xF6n \xB7 taban hasar\u0131n %{0}'i
      \xB7 bedel: {1} sn vuru\u015F duraklamas\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898169
    m_Localized: "tek vuru\u015Fta {0}+ hasat: s\u0131radaki vuru\u015Fun hasar\u0131
      \xD7{1} \xB7 tek hedefe vurursan hak kaybolur"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898170
    m_Localized: "hilal menzili +{0} birim \xB7 hasatla b\xFCy\xFCr: hasar +%{1}
      (en \xE7ok {2} kez), cephe {3} h\xFCcre \xB7 hasats\u0131z ad\u0131m s\u0131f\u0131rlar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898171
    m_Localized: "tek vuru\u015Fta {0}+ hasat: kesilen h\xFCcrelerin tarlan\u0131n
      ortas\u0131na g\xF6re simetri\u011Fine meteor (en \xE7ok {1} h\xFCcre) \xB7
      hasat hasar\u0131n\u0131n %{2}'i \xB7 bekleme {3} sn"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898172
    m_Localized: "\xF6ld\xFCren vuru\u015Fun artan hasar\u0131n\u0131n %{0}'i yandaki
      bitkiye ge\xE7er \xB7 en \xE7ok {1} aktar\u0131m \xB7 her aktar\u0131mda %{2}
      kay\u0131p"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898173
    m_Localized: "tetiklenen saks\u0131 davran\u0131\u015F\u0131 {0} sn sonra bir
      kez daha \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r \xB7 hasar\u0131n %{1}'i \xB7 saks\u0131
      + davran\u0131\u015F ba\u015F\u0131na {2} sn bekleme"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898174
    m_Localized: "{0} ve \xFCst\xFC bitkiyi kendi vuru\u015Funla hasat edince {1}
      sn mevcut davran\u0131\u015F \u015Fanslar\u0131 \xD7{2} \xB7 birikmez, s\xFCre
      yenilenir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898175
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 t\u0131kla: yerle\u015Ftir \xB7 {1}: vazge\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898176
    m_Localized: "VAZGE\xC7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898177
    m_Localized: SINIRSIZ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898178
    m_Localized: Hasattan gelen XP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898179
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Fun. Bir kez al\u0131n\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898180
    m_Localized: "Bir kez al\u0131n\u0131r. Taban 0,10 sn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898181
    m_Localized: "Her saks\u0131 ve davran\u0131\u015F\u0131 bir sald\u0131r\u0131n\u0131n
      zincirinde bir kez denenir. Art\xE7\u0131 ve ikinci dalga zincire kat\u0131lmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898182
    m_Localized: Hasat Ritmi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898183
    m_Localized: 'Ritim:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898184
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Funla yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n hasatlar
      say\u0131l\u0131r. Hak haz\u0131r olunca s\u0131radaki vuru\u015Fun g\xFC\xE7lenir
      (imle\xE7 halkas\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCr). Ek sald\u0131r\u0131 \xFCretmez; davran\u0131\u015Flara
      ge\xE7mez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898185
    m_Localized: Zincir Hasat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898186
    m_Localized: 'Zincir:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898187
    m_Localized: "Bereketli \xD6\u011Frenim"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898188
    m_Localized: "Davran\u0131\u015F hasar\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Fmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898189
    m_Localized: "Davran\u0131\u015Fa Adan\u0131\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898190
    m_Localized: "Patlama \xB7 elektrik \xB7 kas\u0131rga \xB7 bumerang. Kendi vuru\u015Fun
      de\u011Fi\u015Fmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898191
    m_Localized: "A\u011F\u0131r Darbe"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898192
    m_Localized: "Kritik hasar \xE7arpan\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898193
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Fun kriti\u011Fi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898194
    m_Localized: "Alt\u0131n Hedef"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898195
    m_Localized: "Rare ve \xFCst\xFC bitkiye do\u011Frudan hasar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898196
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Fun; Common ve Uncommon de\u011Fi\u015Fmez.
      Davran\u0131\u015F hasar\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Fmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898197
    m_Localized: Bereketli Toprak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898198
    m_Localized: "\xDCretim aral\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898199
    m_Localized: "\xFCretim s\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898200
    m_Localized: "B\xFCt\xFCn saks\u0131lar. Yaln\u0131z tarlan bo\u015Fal\u0131yorsa
      \xE7\u0131kar (son round ortalama doluluk %65'in alt\u0131nda). Taban 0,50
      sn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898201
    m_Localized: Bilgi Filizi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898202
    m_Localized: "Kazan\u0131lan XP"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898203
    m_Localized: "Hasattan gelen XP. Round 30 boss'undan sonra \xE7\u0131kmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898204
    m_Localized: Canavar Kesimi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898205
    m_Localized: "Do\u011Frudan vuru\u015F hasar\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898206
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Fun. Round 25 boss'undan sonra \xE7\u0131kar;
      bir kez al\u0131n\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898207
    m_Localized: "F\u0131rt\u0131na Bile\u011Fi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898208
    m_Localized: "Sald\u0131r\u0131 aral\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898209
    m_Localized: "sald\u0131r\u0131 s\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092416
    m_Localized: "Round 25 boss'undan sonra \xE7\u0131kar; bir kez al\u0131n\u0131r.
      Taban 0,10 sn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092417
    m_Localized: "Geni\u015F Savuru\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092418
    m_Localized: "Vuru\u015F yar\u0131\xE7ap\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092419
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Fun. \u0130mle\xE7 halkas\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCr;
      davran\u0131\u015F alan\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Fmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092420
    m_Localized: "H\u0131zl\u0131 Bilek"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092421
    m_Localized: "Sald\u0131r\u0131 aral\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092422
    m_Localized: "sald\u0131r\u0131 s\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092423
    m_Localized: "Vuru\u015Flar aras\u0131 s\xFCre k\u0131sal\u0131r. Taban 0,10
      sn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092424
    m_Localized: "Keskin B\u0131\xE7ak"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092425
    m_Localized: "Do\u011Frudan vuru\u015F hasar\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092426
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Fun. Davran\u0131\u015F hasar\u0131
      de\u011Fi\u015Fmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092427
    m_Localized: "K\u0131v\u0131lc\u0131m"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092428
    m_Localized: "Mevcut davran\u0131\u015F \u015Fanslar\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092429
    m_Localized: "Patlama \xB7 kas\u0131rga \xB7 bumerang \xB7 elektrik. \u015Eans\u0131
      olmayan saks\u0131ya \u015Fans vermez; en \xE7ok %100."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092430
    m_Localized: "Kritik G\xF6z"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092431
    m_Localized: "Kritik \u015Fans\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092432
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Fun. Y\xFCzde puan\u0131 olarak eklenir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092433
    m_Localized: Nadir Tohum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092434
    m_Localized: Nadirlik bonusu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092435
    m_Localized: "B\xFCt\xFCn saks\u0131lar. Y\xFCzde puan\u0131 olarak eklenir;
      en \xE7ok 95 puan."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092436
    m_Localized: "Y\u0131k\u0131m G\xFCc\xFC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092437
    m_Localized: "Davran\u0131\u015F hasar\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092438
    m_Localized: "Patlama \xB7 kas\u0131rga \xB7 bumerang \xB7 elektrik. Kendi vuru\u015Fun
      de\u011Fi\u015Fmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092439
    m_Localized: "A\xE7g\xF6zl\xFC Hasat"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092440
    m_Localized: "A\xE7g\xF6zl\xFCl\xFCk:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092441
    m_Localized: "Bo\u015F savuru\u015F hakk\u0131 harcamaz. G\xFC\xE7lenen vuru\u015F
      yeni hak kazand\u0131rmaz. Davran\u0131\u015Flara ge\xE7mez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092442
    m_Localized: "A\u015F\u0131r\u0131 Y\xFCkleme"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092443
    m_Localized: "Y\xFCkleme:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092444
    m_Localized: "Ek proc zincire kat\u0131lmaz ve yeni zar atmaz. Kas\u0131rga /
      bumerang aktif s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 a\u015F\u0131lmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092445
    m_Localized: "B\xFCy\xFCyen Ay"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092446
    m_Localized: "B\xFCy\xFCme:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092447
    m_Localized: "Hilal menzili 1 birim artar: 3 \u2192 4. Ana hilal do\u011Fdu\u011Fu
      andan yok olana kadar ilerledi\u011Fi mesafeyle orant\u0131l\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCr;
      ilk hasad\u0131 beklemez. Hasar b\xFCy\xFCmesi ger\xE7ek hasatlara ba\u011Fl\u0131d\u0131r.
      Dolunay ba\u015Ftan b\xFCy\xFCk ve sabittir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092448
    m_Localized: Dolunay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092449
    m_Localized: 'Dolunay:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092450
    m_Localized: "Her ana hilalin yan\u0131nda yaln\u0131z bir b\xFCy\xFCk ek hilal
      \xE7\u0131kar; hasat ko\u015Fulu yoktur. Mouse halkas\u0131ndan do\u011Fdu\u011Fu
      anda, ana hilalden farkl\u0131 rastgele y\xF6nde ilerler. Ba\u015Ftan b\xFCy\xFCkt\xFCr
      ve yeniden Dolunay \xFCretmez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092451
    m_Localized: Elektrik Anteni
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092452
    m_Localized: 'Anten:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092453
    m_Localized: "Anten tarlan\u0131n kenar\u0131nda durur; saks\u0131 ve tile yeri
      kaplamaz. Vuru\u015Fu senin vuru\u015Fun say\u0131lmaz: kritik atmaz, davran\u0131\u015F
      tetiklemez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092454
    m_Localized: "Hasat Yank\u0131s\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092455
    m_Localized: "Yank\u0131:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092456
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Funla yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n hasatlar
      say\u0131l\u0131r. Yank\u0131 yeni yank\u0131 do\u011Furmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092457
    m_Localized: Hilal Darbesi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092458
    m_Localized: 'Hilal:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092459
    m_Localized: "Hilal mouse halkas\u0131n\u0131n kenar\u0131ndan rastgele bir ana
      y\xF6nde \xE7\u0131kar. H\u0131z 8 birim/sn; temel menzil 3, B\xFCy\xFCyen
      Ay ile 4 birimdir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092460
    m_Localized: "\u0130letken Hat"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092461
    m_Localized: 'Hat:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092462
    m_Localized: "\u0130kinci antenin yerini sen se\xE7ersin; hat kurulamayan konum
      se\xE7ilemez. Hat vuru\u015Fu senin vuru\u015Fun say\u0131lmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092463
    m_Localized: "Kapal\u0131 Devre"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092464
    m_Localized: 'Devre:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092465
    m_Localized: "Ek vuru\u015F kendini yeniden ba\u015Flatamaz. Davran\u0131\u015F\u0131
      olan saks\u0131 yoksa \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092466
    m_Localized: Kritik Ark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092467
    m_Localized: 'Ark:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092468
    m_Localized: "Ark, vuru\u015Funun de\u011Fmedi\u011Fi bir bitkiye gider. Kritik
      atmaz, yeni ark do\u011Furmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092469
    m_Localized: "Nadir Reakt\xF6r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092470
    m_Localized: "Reakt\xF6r:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092471
    m_Localized: "Patlama \xB7 kas\u0131rga \xB7 bumerang \xB7 elektrik. \u015Eans\u0131
      olmayan saks\u0131ya \u015Fans vermez; en \xE7ok %100."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092472
    m_Localized: "Ta\u015Fan Hasar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092473
    m_Localized: "Ta\u015Fma:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092474
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z kendi vuru\u015Funun \xF6ld\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFC bitkiden
      ba\u015Flar. Aktar\u0131m kritik atmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092475
    m_Localized: "Art\xE7\u0131 Patlama"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092476
    m_Localized: "Art\xE7\u0131 patlama:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092477
    m_Localized: "Patlaman\u0131n d\u0131\u015F s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131ndan \xFC\xE7
      ad\u0131m yay\u0131l\u0131r. Ayn\u0131 h\xFCcreye bir kez vurur; kilitli h\xFCcrelerden
      ge\xE7mez. Art\xE7\u0131 yeni art\xE7\u0131 veya zincir ba\u015Flatmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092478
    m_Localized: "\xC7ifte Ak\u0131m"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092479
    m_Localized: "\u0130kinci elektrik dalgas\u0131:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092480
    m_Localized: "\u015Eans\u0131 tutan her normal elektrikten sonra ayn\u0131 saks\u0131dan
      ikinci bir dalga. Yeni \u015Fans at\u0131lmaz; ikinci dalga zincir ba\u015Flatmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092481
    m_Localized: SON ROUND!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092482
    m_Localized: "{0} SAN\u0130YE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092483
    m_Localized: ROUND {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092484
    m_Localized: "KOTA {0} \xB7 {1} ROUND"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092485
    m_Localized: "SON ROUND \xB7 KOTAYA {0} KALDI"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092486
    m_Localized: LEVEL UP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092487
    m_Localized: Lv. {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092488
    m_Localized: "de\u011Fi\u015Fiklik yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092489
    m_Localized: "do\u011Frudan \xD7{0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092490
    m_Localized: "davran\u0131\u015F \xD7{0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092491
    m_Localized: "hasat kayna\u011F\u0131 \xD7{0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092492
    m_Localized: "BOSS GE\xC7\u0130LD\u0130 \xB7 UZMANLA\u015EMA SE\xC7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092493
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z biri al\u0131n\u0131r \xB7 run sonuna kadar ge\xE7erli
      \xB7 geri al\u0131namaz \xB7 etkisi Round {0} ve sonras\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092494
    m_Localized: Bonus yok, ceza yok
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092495
    m_Localized: "Hasar ve hasat geliri oldu\u011Fu gibi kal\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092496
    m_Localized: "Do\u011Frudan hasar \xD7{0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092497
    m_Localized: "Davran\u0131\u015F hasar\u0131 \xD7{0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092498
    m_Localized: "patlama \xB7 kas\u0131rga \xB7 bumerang \xB7 elektrik"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092499
    m_Localized: "Hasat kayna\u011F\u0131 \xD7{0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092500
    m_Localized: "hasattan gelen Gold \xB7 Iron \xB7 Stone"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092501
    m_Localized: "SE\xC7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092502
    m_Localized: "DAVRANI\u015E USTASI"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092503
    m_Localized: "MEVCUT D\xDCZEN\u0130 KORU"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092504
    m_Localized: "USTA B\u0130\xC7\u0130C\u0130"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092505
    m_Localized: SAKSILAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092506
    m_Localized: "B\u0130R SAKSI SE\xC7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092507
    m_Localized: "SE\xC7. EK. B\xDCY\xDCT."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092508
    m_Localized: "YETENEK A\u011EACI"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092509
    m_Localized: YOK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092510
    m_Localized: "Katalogdan a\xE7\u0131k bir saks\u0131 se\xE7."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092511
    m_Localized: SATIN AL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092512
    m_Localized: '{0}x{1} SAKSI'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092513
    m_Localized: '{0} sn'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092514
    m_Localized: "{1} i\xE7in {0} ekim yeri."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092515
    m_Localized: "{0} bo\u015F, a\xE7\u0131k h\xFCcre gerekir. Yerle\u015Ftirirken
      R d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092516
    m_Localized: "s\u0131radaki \xFCr\xFCn\xFCn"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092517
    m_Localized: SATIN AL  /  {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092518
    m_Localized: "Saks\u0131 ayar\u0131 eksik."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092519
    m_Localized: "Bu saks\u0131y\u0131 yetenek a\u011Fac\u0131nda a\xE7."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
